---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Notice — Draft"
  description="Draft privacy notice for Coop's Mobile Detailing. Owner and legal approval are required before production publication."
  noindex
>
  <section class="legal-page section-light">
    <article class="legal-content shell">
      <p class="eyebrow">Draft · owner approval required</p>
      <h1>Privacy notice</h1>
      <div class="legal-alert"><strong>Not yet approved for production.</strong><p>This draft records how the current static website is designed to operate. The business owner must approve the final legal wording, effective date, and any analytics or platform data practices before launch.</p></div>
      <h2>Information submitted through this website</h2>
      <p>This static website does not include a contact form, account, payment flow, or booking system. It does not intentionally collect information through a website form.</p>
      <h2>Calling and texting</h2>
      <p>If you choose a call or text link, your device and telecommunications provider handle that communication. Information you send directly to the business may include your phone number, vehicle details, requested service, and service location.</p>
      <h2>Third-party links</h2>
      <p>The site may link to Instagram. A third-party service applies its own privacy practices when you leave this website.</p>
      <h2>Analytics and platform services</h2>
      <p>No analytics vendor is declared in this customer-site source. If OmniReach enables production analytics or other platform services, this notice must be updated and approved before those services are activated.</p>
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>Use the verified phone contact on the <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a> for questions about the business. A verified privacy email has not been supplied.</p>
      <p class="legal-footnote">Effective date: pending owner approval.</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</Layout>
